mance plan is ₹120."}]},{"question":"What is the difference between the Cheap, Budget, and Performance plans?","answer":["$","p",null,{"children":"The Cheap plan uses an Intel Xeon E5-2620 v4 CPU. The Budget plan uses the Intel Xeon 6 family. The Performance plan uses either an AMD EPYC 9755 or an Intel Core Ultra 9, depending on the hosting node assigned to your order. All three are RAM-priced and include SSD storage."}]},{"question":"Is SSD storage included?","answer":["$","p",null,{"children":"Yes. SSD storage is included with all Minecraft hosting plans. The exact storage allocation depends on the selected plan and RAM."}]},{"question":"What is the maximum RAM I can order online?","answer":["$","p",null,{"children":["Online Minecraft plans currently support selections from 1 GB to"," ",32," GB of RAM."]}]},{"question":"Can I get more than 32 GB RAM?","answer":["$","p",null,{"children":["Yes. If you need more than ",32," GB of RAM, contact HDXCLOUD support through a Discord ticket"," ","once the official invite is published"," ","for custom requirements."]}]},{"question":"How do I access my services?","answer":["$","p",null,{"children":["Minecraft and general services are managed from the"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://billing.hdxcloud.xyz","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"text-accent-cyan hover:underline","children":"Client Area"}],". Virtual servers are managed from the"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://vms.hdxclouds.com","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"text-accent-cyan hover:underline","children":"VPS / VM Panel"}],"."]}]},{"question":"Where can I manage my VPS or VM?","answer":["$","p",null,{"children":["VPS and VM services are managed through the dedicated portal at"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://vms.hdxclouds.com","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"text-accent-cyan hover:underline","children":"vms.hdxclouds.com"}],"."]}]},{"question":"Where can I find the terms and poli